    "sections": {
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload entire <code>go-to-post-id</code> directory to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory, or install the plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; screen in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='i%20enter%20a%20post%20id%20but%20all%20i%20get%20is%20an%20error.%20why%3F'>\nI enter a post ID but all I get is an error. Why?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Either the post with given ID does not exist or post ID contains some invalid and/or invisible characters. Entered post ID is used as is, without any filtering.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Display input in admin bar. Input is displayed only to users that can &#8220;edit_posts&#8221;</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "description": "<p>Provide input in admin bar to jump to edit post page by post ID. Only users that can &#8220;edit_posts&#8221; will see it.</p>\n"
    },
